   :problem "A hypothetical call error is not necessarily a policy denial: external-path unavailability and invalid input also error. Encoding all errors as 'denied' fails the requested actual-result semantics and can make an operational-path failure look like policy causation. Actual deny itself is represented by an error, so merely excluding all errors would also be wrong."
